data:
Hades is:

when you’re killing half the Tartarus to get a new dog bowl and drapes;
when your best friend is Death;
when the only thing that your girlfriend has is her head and you ;
when punching skeleton works under a contract;
when you got a job using no dad's help but it's all about punishment ;
when you thought you got a roguelike but there’s only one thing that you got. It was a dating sim.

10 fugitive Princes of Hell out of 10
(1 escape out of many attempts)
